<title>USA: First Liberty Financial Corp sets payout.</title>
<headline>First Liberty Financial Corp sets payout.</headline>
<dateline>MACON, Ga. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $0.13		     $0.13</p>
<p> Pay		     Oct 1</p>
<p> Record		Sept 15</p>
<p>Note: The dividend will be paid on a pre-split basis. The company also announced a 3-for-2 stock split payable on October 1.</p>
